     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各位專家們好:<div>                        當我用sjPlot套件中tab_model的語法時，會出現Error in UseMethod(&quot;family&quot;) : </div><div>  no applicable method for &#39;family&#39; applied to an object of class &quot;logical&quot;</div><div>這段話，請問是甚麼原因呢？</div><div>附上語法檔，謝謝各位。</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
